\viewkind4\uc1\pard\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0  Sing to God the song of His love;
\par      God's love for us never fades.
\par      Who soever has seen His love,
\par      knows that He deserves His praise.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par      Should the Mighty God gets furious,
\par      into fire he sweeps us;
\par      and when He shows His love to us,
\par       we give honour to His name.
\par 
\par \pard\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  The love of God comes through His Son
\par       and reveal so dear to us.
\par      The love of Christ surpass seeing
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj and that we see not so clear,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj unless through His Holy Spirit
\par we are strengthen by His pow'r,
\par and deeply rooted in His love
\par for, our faith in Him is strong.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  The depth of God's love is deeper
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 it embrases the whole word;
\par and the love of God is so long;
\par everlasting and no end.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par It is deep it comes from Heaven
\par and decends into our woes.
\par It's so high and it shall raise us
\par \cf1 into the kingdom of God.
\par \cf0 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  T'is beyond my understanding,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 but my heart so believe it.
\par Jesus loves me, satan hates me,
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0      and sets me a trap always.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6  Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par      Jesus, let Thy love keep me safe
\par      let me keep on loving you!
\par      Then I shall sing to give you praise
\par      That my love shall be well pleased.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

